Package: bullseyeR
Title: Site-Level Differential RNA Editing Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Mathieu",
        family = "Flamand",
        email = "mathieu.flamand@crchudequebec.ulaval.ca",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Performs site-level differential editing analysis using
    binomial, quasibinomial, and beta-binomial models. Supports
    fixed-effect multifactor designs, numeric covariates, interactions,
    and user-defined linear contrasts. Provides coverage filtering,
    multiple-testing correction, cross-platform parallel computation,
    and model-fitting diagnostics.
